---
description: UI primitives, pages, and visual system rules
globs: components/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx},app/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/constitutions/ui-design.md`, `docs/constitutions/shadcn.md`, and `docs/constitutions/tailwind.md` before changing UI.

- Prefer existing `components/ui` primitives over new ones.
- Install new shadcn components with the CLI, then restyle to project tokens.
- Every new or materially changed `components/ui/*` primitive must ship with an Overview example on `/`.
- Floating overlays use soft shadow + hairline `border-border/50`, never full-strength outlines.
- Interactive elements need hover states and correct cursors; text stays selectable.
- Use Dialog for blocking work, Sheet for secondary side flows, Dropdown Menu for actions, Tooltip for icon-only explanation, Alert Dialog for irreversible confirmation.
- Render switches with `SwitchField` so the label dims when off.
